 L->>DS: stream chat (thinking, tool_choice=auto,<br/>include_usage, user_id)
 DS-->>L: reasoning_content deltas
 DS-->>L: content deltas
 DS-->>L: tool_calls + usage frame
 alt no tool calls
 L-->>U: final answer
 else tool calls present
 L->>L: stuck-loop circuit breaker<br/>(same call 3× → stop)
 L->>L: replay assistant turn<br/>WITH reasoning_content
 par parallel tools (cap 4)
 L->>TL: execute calls
 TL-->>L: results (in call order)
 end
 L->>DS: tool results appended
 end
